{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15077","headline":"秦镜 · 张佐","name":"秦镜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楼上秦时镜，千秋独有名。\n菱花寒不落，冰质夏长清。\n龙在形难掩，人来胆易呈。\n昇台宜远照，开匣乍藏明。\n皎色新磨出，圆规旧铸成。\n愁容如可鉴，当欲拂尘缨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张佐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15077.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15077","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}